    body: [
      "Aro builds ulo. As the work advances we may add, change, or retire features. Before a change that materially reduces functionality you depend on, we will give reasonable notice where we can.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Eligibility and accounts",
    body: [
      "You must be able to form a binding contract to use the Services. Where an account is required, you are responsible for keeping its credentials safe and for the activity that happens under it. Tell us promptly if you suspect unauthorized use.",
