  {
    heading: "Third-party services",
    body: [
      "The Services may connect to third-party tools and models. Your use of those is governed by their own terms, and we are not responsible for how they behave.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Export control",
    body: [
      "You may not access or use the Services in violation of U.S. export control or economic sanctions laws — including if you are located in, or ordinarily resident in, a country or region subject to U.S. embargo, or if you are listed on any U.S. government restricted-party list. By using the Services, you represent that neither applies to you.",
